    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A SUPER SPACIOUS AND LIGHT FILLED GEM.  June McConnell Residential are delighted to bring this EXTRA spacious and well laid out three bed apartment to the market for sale.  Located on the third floor, the property is light-filled and presented in walk-in condition.  Royal Canal Park apartments are sought after mainly for their excellent location but also for their generous size and finishes.  The location is second-to-none and offers easy access to all areas and amenities that Royal Canal Park has to offer.   There is a choice of shops and supermarkets in the development.  Pelletstown train station is a short stroll from the property plus the 20bus service passes through every 8 minutes.  Viewing is highly recommended. Sold with fixtures and fittings and furniture."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation is as follows: A spacious entrance hall with generous storage and utility. An attractive and bright open plan lounge and dining. There is a fully fitted moder kitchen   Family   bathroom with bath and shower.  Twp Large double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes and a generous single bedroom.. There is an en-suite bathroom off the Master bedroom. Attractive balcony.  Access to communal gardens. Designated underground car space."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Features include:\r\n•\tDouble glazing\r\n•\tPresented in walk-in condition\r\n•\tVery generous size\r\n•\tECH\r\n•\tAttractive  well maintained development\r\n•\tUnderground designated car space\r\n•\tSet in well-kept communal gardens\r\n•\tGenerous storage\r\n•\tSuperb sought-after location \r\n•\tFree use of on-site gym\r\n•\t24-Hour on-site security\r\n•\t Intercom\r\n•\t 5 minute walk to Pelletstown train station\r\n•\t5 minute walk to No. 20 bus stop"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B3"
      }
